<title>UK: Cruden Bay says to buy Technolog Group.</title>
<headline>Cruden Bay says to buy Technolog Group.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cruden Bay Plc said on Monday that it had acquired Technolog Group Ltd, an electronic instruments firm, for an initial 20.16 million stg.</p>
<p>The company would also pay a deferred consideration of up to 7.5 million stg depending on Technolog's profits to June 30, 1998.</p>
</text>
